 "as_of": "2026-10-05",
 "descriptor": "US generics and CDMO pharma company",
 "lede": "A young pharma company that has beaten its own growth guidance since listing, built on acquired US ANDAs, contract manufacturing and emerging markets. Profit is growing fast but cash isn't yet; the price assumes the next three years go to plan.",
 "market": {
  "price": 1350,
